                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='17126' id='52' type-v2='text' w='98556' x='722' y='81713'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>The retention rate of users more than 1-3 months after first visiting the store is almost 0, and it is very low even 1-3 months after the initial visit. This implies that the vast majority of users do not come back to the store after their first visit, which could also explain why aggregate user-level and session-level data are almost identically distributed</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{EAACFFDC-1182-4DE8-ABBC-7F402C10D900}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Statistics Table Analysis'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='860' maxwidth='650' minheight='560' minwidth='420' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='48841' id='3' type-v2='text' w='97538' x='1231' y='1159'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='20'>Statistics Table Analysis</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='48841' id='5' type-v2='text' w='97538' x='1231' y='50000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>* The vast majority of transactions and revenue came from the Americas despite there being a comparable number of active users from other continents. This implies that people from other continents are viewing the store but not purchasing from it. This could potentially be improved if we figure out why people in other continents aren&apos;t purchasing from the store and try to fix that.

* Most of the revenue (Approx. $1.2M) came from direct traffic with around $230K coming from Google, $77K from DFA, and less coming from all the other sources combined. We could prioritize these 3 sources for our revenue or focus on building a stronger presence with other sources that are not our most profitable sources, like Bing or Yahoo.

* The vast majority of revenue (≈ 98.35%) did not come from a campaign at all, so perhaps campaigns are not worth pursuing</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='9' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='97682' id='8' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='97538' x='1231' y='1159'>
                <zone h='48841' id='3' type-v2='text' w='97538' x='1231' y='1159'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='20'>Statistics Table Analysis</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
